          "headline": "First Impeachment Complaint Filed Against President Marcos",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-01-19&search=First%20Impeachment%20Complaint%20Filed%20Against%20President%20Marcos",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Lawyer Andre de Jesus filed the first impeachment complaint against President Marcos, endorsed by Pusong Pinoy Rep. Jett Nisay, citing the ICC arrest of Rodrigo Duterte, alleged drug use, and the flood-control scandal. A second leftist complaint on January 22 alleged the House blocked receipt. Legal observers noted that a dismissed complaint would give Marcos a one-year impeachment bar just as the House rewrote rules for a new case against Vice President Sara Duterte.</p>",
