          "headline": "Second Arrest Warrant Issued vs Atong Ang - Interpol Red Notice Requested",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-01-17&search=Second%20Arrest%20Warrant%20Issued%20vs%20Atong%20Ang%20-%20Interpol%20Red%20Notice%20Requested",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Lipa City RTC issued a second warrant against Ang and 20 others for six kidnapping-with-homicide counts, and CIDG asked Interpol for a red notice. Seventeen of 18 first-warrant co-accused were already arrested; PNP revoked Ang's firearms licenses. Remulla called him armed and dangerous, with immigration records still showing no departure.</p>",
