          "headline": "Binaliw Landfill Recovery Concludes - Final Death Toll 36",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-01-18&search=Binaliw%20Landfill%20Recovery%20Concludes%20-%20Final%20Death%20Toll%2036",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Retrieval at Binaliw ended with 36 workers dead and 18 injured. Mines and Geosciences Bureau cited oversaturated waste, slope instability, and poor drainage at a site found to be violating the Ecological Solid Waste Management Act. Metro Cebu remained without its primary dump under the DENR cease-and-desist order.</p>",
