          "headline": "Tropical Storm Ada Kills 2 in Bicol - Landslides and Flooding Hit Visayas",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-01-19&search=Tropical%20Storm%20Ada%20Kills%202%20in%20Bicol%20-%20Landslides%20and%20Flooding%20Hit%20Visayas",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Ada killed at least two people in Matnog, Sorsogon, when a landslide destroyed a house, flooded Albay towns, and sent lahar down Mayon toward Legazpi. More than 5,000 passengers were stranded at Matnog port. The storm weakened to a low-pressure area on January 21 after flooding Caraga, Eastern Visayas, and Bicol.</p>",
