          "headline": "Mayon Volcano Eruption Continues - Lahar Warnings Issued",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-01-20&search=Mayon%20Volcano%20Eruption%20Continues%20-%20Lahar%20Warnings%20Issued",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>PHIVOLCS kept Alert Level 3 and counted 50 pyroclastic density currents in 24 hours as Ada's rain raised lahar risk in channels around Mayon. More than 4,000 residents remained in 14 shelters. Director Teresito Bacolcol said a jump to Level 4 was still unlikely.</p>",
